defects.claim:
When the single computation raises, the fallback threads the CALLER's (orchestrator) dict into scoring_v2 through precomputed_confidence. That is the design the review rejected. Measured with compute_confidence forced to raise (probe 1, test_p4), google x2 shape with both prices pended:
- flag ON: scoring_v2.confidence_legs = {strong, strong, strong}
- flag OFF under the same raise: {weak, weak, weak}
The branch is also untested: mutant N4 (fallback -> {}) survives, 250 passed.
